  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SARA-fair and mission 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contains a mission to the biggest regional agro-fair of West Africa, the SARA, in C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire in November 2019. A group of 20 Dutch organisations will join a 4-day Private Sector Development program, including representation in the Holland Lounge during the fair. The Lounge will have the theme Climate Smart Agriculture and serve as a forum for thematic discussion and knowledge exchange. During the ten days of the SARA, this space will be used by both Dutch and Regional enterprises in poultry and horticulture. The last weekend the Lounge will be hosted by Ivorian start-ups.</narrative>
  </description>
